---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
    title="Privacy Policy"
    description="How PressFolio handles your data. Basic conversion runs entirely in your browser. Optional AI enhancement sends your extracted parameters to NaraRouter to generate the draft."
>
    <Header />
    
    <main class="container">
        <article class="legal-content" style="padding: 3rem 0;">
            <h1 style="font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 2rem;">Last updated: August 2026</p>

            <h2>1. User Data Non-Retention</h2>
            <p>Basic conversion is a client-side operation. Parsing, formatting, and export all happen inside your web browser, and that text never reaches our servers. We do not:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Upload, transmit, or store text you enter in Basic mode</li>
                <li>Collect any personal information from users</li>
                <li>Maintain any user accounts or profiles</li>
            </ul>
            <p>
                The one exception is <strong>AI Enhancement</strong>. When you opt into an AI-generated draft, the
                extracted parameters (title, source, date, quote, figures, and context — not your full pasted text)
                are sent to our server and forwarded to NaraRouter to produce the draft. AI Enhancement is off by
                default; if you never select it, nothing leaves your browser.
            </p>

            <h2>2. Local Storage</h2>
            <p>We use browser localStorage to store:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Theme Preference:</strong> Your light/dark mode selection</li>
                <li><strong>Draft Auto-Save:</strong> Your current work-in-progress (last 5 minutes)</li>
            </ul>
            <p>This data stays on your device and is never transmitted to our servers.</p>

            <h2>3. Third-Party Services</h2>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Google Fonts:</strong> Used for typography. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google Privacy Policy</a></li>
                <li><strong>Google AdSense:</strong> For advertising. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google Privacy Policy</a></li>
                <li><strong>NaraRouter:</strong> Processes AI Enhancement requests. Only the extracted parameters are sent. See <a href="https://nara.id">nara.id</a></li>
            </ul>

            <h2>4. Cookies</h2>
            <p><strong>Essential:</strong> Theme preference cookie (1 year)<br>
            <strong>Advertising:</strong> Third-party AdSense cookies may be used</p>

            <h2>5. Your Rights</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Clear your browser's localStorage to remove saved data</li>
                <li>Opt out of personalized ads via <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads">Google Ads Settings</a></li>
                <li>Disable cookies in your browser (may affect site functionality)</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>6. Contact</h2>
            <p>Questions about this policy? <a href="/contact">Contact us</a>.</p>
        </article>
    </main>

    <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
